      "text": "Cartagena"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d4916e5b1ff058343af7891b4b8f42a09899760ece4211c4bc7795d87530effa",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-chat-20261110-0451-41d9d0b7bf00",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, meet your English-speaking guide for a sightseeing tour of Cartagena. The city's historic centre is a UNESCO World Heritage Site, enclosed by extensive fortifications.\n\nYou'll see old neighbourhoods, churches and monuments, and visit the 17th-century San Felipe de Barajas fortress. Another stop is Cerro de la Popa and its hilltop monastery, which has panoramic views over the city.\n\nCartagena sits on the Caribbean coast, where a fortified old town and colonial architecture meet modern resort life. After the tour, return to the hotel and take some time to relax."
    },
